---

GrabQueue is a download-queue front-end. It does not include or bundle its
download engines. At runtime it downloads yt-dlp, gallery-dl, and FFmpeg from
their official release channels; each is licensed separately by its own
project (yt-dlp: Unlicense; gallery-dl: GPLv2; FFmpeg: LGPL/GPL). GrabQueue is
not affiliated with or endorsed by those projects or by any website.
